% Two Hands (ability catalogue)
%
% A heavy sentinel machine stands on a bridge over a pit. Two companions,
% one skill each, from a pool of seven catalogue skills. No skill takes it
% alone - not even when both companions hold it - and several pairs do, by
% two methods.
%
%   ledge --- bridge (sentinel) --- far
%     |          |
%     |         pit          (across the pit: overlook, reached by a path)
%   path --- overlook
%
% Two ways to take it out, each needing two different things:
%   drop it   it is heavy, and heavy wards forced movement: turn it to mist
%             (turnToMist - for a moment it is not heavy), then, while the
%             moment lasts, move it into the pit: push it from the ledge
%             (fireball, tidalWave), pull it across the pit from the
%             overlook (hook, taunt), or draw it down into the pit
%             (vortex)
%   short it  it is a machine: soak it (tidalWave), then jolt it
%             (lightningFlash) - one companion soaks, the other jolts
%
% Traps:
%   - any push, pull or vortex alone: the sentinel is heavy and does not
%     budge; a hook on it drags the caster to the sentinel instead;
%   - a jolt on the dry machine only stuns it; blizzard on the soaked one
%     only freezes it (a stun, not out);
%   - the mist lasts one more cast: whoever mists cannot also push.
region(ledge).
region(bridge).
region(far).
region(pit).
region(path).
region(overlook).
connected(ledge, bridge).
connected(bridge, ledge).
connected(bridge, far).
connected(far, bridge).
connected(bridge, pit).
connected(pit, bridge).
connected(ledge, path).
connected(path, ledge).
connected(path, overlook).
connected(overlook, path).
lineOfSight(ledge, bridge).
lineOfSight(ledge, pit).
lineOfSight(overlook, bridge).
lineOfSight(overlook, pit).

% Push lines: from the ledge, a push on the bridge lands in the pit; from
% the overlook, the pit lies between it and the bridge.
beyond(ledge, bridge, pit).
beyond(overlook, pit, bridge).
onEnter(pit, chasm).

role(player, player).
role(mage, companion).
at(player, ledge).
at(mage, ledge).
mana(player, 4).
mana(mage, 4).

role(sentinel, enemy).
at(sentinel, bridge).
tag(sentinel, machine).
tag(sentinel, heavy).

% === Default kit: one skill each (the test replans the whole matrix) ===
knows(player, turnToMist).
knows(mage, fireball).

win :- if(), do(neutralize(sentinel)).

funExpect(single_actor_plans, atMost, 0).

% === Choice: one skill each, from seven (htn_components combos) ===
comboSeat(player, 1).
comboSeat(mage, 1).
comboPool(turnToMist).
comboPool(fireball).
comboPool(tidalWave).
comboPool(hook).
comboPool(taunt).
comboPool(vortex).
comboPool(lightningFlash).
comboMinWins(12).
comboMinMethods(6).

goals(win).
